<h1>Welcome to Solo Self Tracking!</h1>

<h5>Still sane, Exile?</h5>

<p>
    Solo Self Tracking is a web application that runs entirely on your device. If you can see this page in your web browser, you're good to start tracking. <br />
    All data is stored locally. If you wish to share your data with the community, you can share your local database here: (tbd future project).
</p>

